<title>USA: Veritas sets three-for-two stock split.</title>
<headline>Veritas sets three-for-two stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Veritas Software Corp said Tuesday it approved a three-for-two stock split.</p>
<p>Every two shares of outstanding common stock will be converted into three shares through a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The split is effective on September 17 for shareholders of record on that date and is payable on September 30.</p>
<p>Veritas, a maker of disk and storage management software, has some 8.9 million shares outstanding.</p>
